# Testing Solutions Locally

Before submitting code on an assessment, always test against custom inputs:

### Test Suite Structure
Create a small test harness array containing sample inputs and edge cases:

```javascript
const testCases = [
  { input: [1, 2, 3], expected: 6 },
  { input: [], expected: 0 },
  { input: [-5, 5], expected: 0 },
  { input: [1000], expected: 1000 }
];

for (const { input, expected } of testCases) {
  const result = solve(input);
  console.assert(result === expected, `Failed for input ${input}: got ${result}, expected ${expected}`);
}
```

